  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>The Oak Escape<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Escape to the heart of Seagrove Beach and settle down at this coastal charmer! Nestled in the perfect location for coastal adventure, you'll be just minutes away from the Seaside Amphitheater, Seagrove Beach, Grayton Beach State Park, the Point Washington Forest, and a variety of delicious eateries and vibrant boutiques. <br><br><br><br>Back at your stay, you'll have no issue making yourself right at home amidst the open layout, high ceilings, and nautical mementos. The living room's oversized sofa and smart TV offer the perfect combination for evening movie viewings. Just as comfortable, the large window-side seat is great for afternoon reading sessions. Well-equipped for all of your culinary needs, the kitchen boasts updated appliances, ample meal prep space, and a breakfast bar. <br><br><br><br>Ceiling fans, soft linens, and plenty of natural lighting adorn the three bedrooms, making sweet dreams inevitable. Central air-conditioning and a private washer/dryer round out the interior list of amenities. <br><br><br><br>Outside, the enclosed yard not only features an outdoor shower but also Adirondack chairs and a gas grill. <br><br><br><br><b>Things to Know</b><br><br>Check-in time: 4:00 p.m.<br><br>Check-out time: 10:00 a.m.<br><br>All guests shall abide by the good neighbor policy and shall not engage in illegal activity. Quiet hours are from 10:00 p.m. to 8:00 a.m.<br><br>No smoking is permitted anywhere on the premises.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Centrally located home with enclosed yard, grill, high ceilings, smart TVs, & AC"
        }
      ],
